    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Colleran Auctioneers are delighted to present 8 St Bridget`s Place, Bohermore, Galway, a four-bedroom property offering an exciting renovation opportunity within walking distance of Galway City Centre.\n\nExtending to approximately 102.9 sq.m / 1,108 sq.ft, the property requires comprehensive modernisation but offers enormous potential for a builder, investor or purchaser looking for a project where they can add considerable value.\n\nThe spacious accommodation comprises an entrance hall, sitting room with solid fuel stove, a large kitchen/dining room with open fireplace and access to the rear yard, together with one ground-floor bedroom. Upstairs there are three further bedrooms and a bathroom.\n\nWith four bedrooms already in place, generous accommodation and an exceptionally convenient City centre location, 8 St Bridget`s Place represents an excellent opportunity for a builder or experienced renovator to transform an older city property, improve its energy efficiency and add value."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 3.4m (11'2\") x 2m (6'7\")\n\nSitting Room - 3.5m (11'6\") x 3m (9'10\")\nWith solid fuel stove.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.8m (19'0\") x 3.2m (10'6\")\nWith fitted kitchen units, open fireplace and door to back yard.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.7m (12'2\") x 2.8m (9'2\")\n\nFirst Floor\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.6m (11'10\") x 3.5m (11'6\")\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.8m (9'2\") x 2.5m (8'2\")\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.2m (13'9\") x 1.9m (6'3\")\n\nBathroom - 2.9m (9'6\") x 2.2m (7'3\")\nFitted with shower, toilet and wash hand basin.\n\nArea\n102.9 sqm/1,107.60 sq.ft\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Galway City Centre four bedroom property. </li><li> Requires comprehensive modernisation but offers enormous potential. </li><li> Terraced property with large front garden, back yard with rear entrance. </li><li> Located less than a 5 minute stroll from Eyre Square.</li></ul>"
      },
